{"text":"Your book said the shaking comes within minutes. It's right. The ground starts to move. Not like a footstep. Like the whole world. The river pulls back. Then it comes back, the wrong way. A wall of water runs upstream and throws fish onto the bank. It climbs up the bank, and stops a hand below your door. When it pulls back, you run down and grab every fish you can carry. Food for the dark. The last thing on your list. The end of the world just handed it to you. This isn't imagination. In North Dakota, scientists found fossil fish with tiny glass beads from this impact stuck in their gills.","alignment":{"characters":["Y","o","u","r"," ","b","o","o","k"," ","s","a","i","d"," ","t","h","e"," ","s","h","a","k","i","n","g"," ","c","o","m","e","s"," ","w","i","t","h","i","n"," ","m","i","n","u","t","e","s","."," ","I","t","'","s"," ","r","i","g","h","t","."," ","T","h","e"," ","g","r","o","u","n","d"," ","s","t","a","r","t","s"," ","t","o"," ","m","o","v","e","."," ","N","o","t"," ","l","i","k","e"," ","a"," ","f","o","o","t","s","t","e","p","."," ","L","i","k","e"," ","t","h","e"," ","w","h","o","l","e"," ","w","o","r","l","d","."," ","T","h","e"," ","r","i","v","e","r"," ","p","u","l","l","s"," ","b","a","c","k","."," ","T","h","e","n"," ","i","t"," ","c","o","m","e","s"," ","b","a","c","k",","," ","t","h","e"," ","w","r","o","n","g"," ","w","a","y","."," ","A"," ","w","a","l","l"," ","o","f"," ","w","a","t","e","r"," ","r","u","n","s"," ","u","p","s","t","r","e","a","m"," ","a","n","d"," ","t","h","r","o","w","s"," ","f","i","s","h"," ","o","n","t","o"," ","t","h","e"," ","b","a","n","k","."," ","I","t"," ","c","l","i","m","b","s"," ","u","p"," ","t","h","e"," ","b","a","n","k",","," ","a","n","d"," ","s","t","o","p","s"," ","a"," ","h","a","n","d"," ","b","e","l","o","w"," ","y","o","u","r"," ","d","o","o","r","."," ","W","h","e","n"," ","i","t"," ","p","u","l","l","s"," ","b","a","c","k",","," ","y","o","u"," ","r","u","n"," ","d","o","w","n"," ","a","n","d